  <item>
    <title>张婉婷和宋宁峰，不会离婚，因为是双向奔赴的病友</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69df8305b977fb2c4705c56a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69df8305b977fb2c4705c56a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 Apr 2026 12:31:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎧推荐语</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期不是简单吃瓜，而是一次很典型的“亲密关系病理切片”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当一段关系里：</span><br><span>有人必须“有用”才配被爱，</span><br><span>有人靠“装弱”持续索取，</span><br><span>再加上高浓度情绪成瘾，</span></p><span></span><p><span>你会发现——</span><br><span>他们不是在谈恋爱，是在互相喂养彼此的缺陷。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听完你可能会不舒服，但你也会更清醒：</span><br><span>很多你以为的“放不下”，其实只是心理机制在自洽。</span></p><span></span><h1><span>本期金句</span></h1><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>他们不是离不开彼此，是离不开这种高浓度情绪。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>她需要“有用”才配被爱，他需要“装弱”来被拯救。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>越是看起来弱的人，越可能在关系里掌控节奏。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>很多关系不是相爱，是彼此刚好匹配对方的缺陷。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>人最容易上瘾的，从来不是爱，是情绪的浓度。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><span> 事件引入：从“要离婚”到“肝胆相照不离”</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a></span></strong><span> 张婉婷的底层逻辑：极度缺爱+必须“有用”</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a></span></strong><span> 关系本质：拯救者 vs 被拯救者的互相成瘾</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a></span></strong><span> 宋宁峰的模式：被动攻击+弱者伪装</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a></span></strong><span> 小三Q女士：同样的“拯救者心理”</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a></span></strong><span> 权力感来源：被乞求、被需要的快感</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a></span></strong><span> 为什么他们不会离婚：高强度互补结构</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a></span></strong><span> 闭环关系解析：控制→出轨→爆发→再绑定</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a></span></strong><span> 最炸裂行为：带女儿出轨的心理动机（报复+刺激）</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a></span></strong><span> 结论：不是爱情，是情绪成瘾与人格互锁</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主播：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>菲凡：外企hr，野生博主，INTP</span></p><span></span><p><span>Echo（小丹）：上海医药猎头合伙人，前500强人力资源经理，面试/转行/职业规划咨询师, ENTP</span></p><span></span><p><span>-互动联系-</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务/听友群加微信： lynnwang823</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6557168111bc0968367abaf8/lqHV9SMAaWLgz0txY6TbxgJCjkDg.m4a" length="29271455" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvcDKMqsuMVu7IQ7a71x1Ii0XiJ7.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
