  <item>
    <title>别把平台当能力：从闫学晶翻车聊到职场“去滤镜”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69679236ef1cf272a75f9a6e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69679236ef1cf272a75f9a6e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Jan 2026 13:15:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>🎧 本期简介</span></h2><span></span><p><span>这一期从 </span><strong><span>闫学晶事件后续</span></strong><span> 聊起：道歉、代言下架、春晚缺席——“黑红”到底有没有用？</span><br><span>聊着聊着就拐进职场：</span><strong><span>为什么现在越来越卷、越来越容易背刺？</span></strong><br><span>最后落到人生观和投资观：</span><strong><span>别把快乐当唯一目标，也别指望“不研究就发财”的爽感。</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>⏱️ 章节时间轴（Chapters）</span></h2><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><span> 开场：事件后续速报（道歉/下架/春晚）</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a></span></strong><span> 🔥 黑红的边界：能红≠能稳，价值观翻车反噬更快</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a></span></strong><span> 🧩 “平台红利”幻觉：</span><strong><span>把平台当能力</span></strong><span>，优越感翻车很快</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a></span></strong><span> 🗡️ 职场真实案例：新人被捧成“嫡系”，最后被设局清出去</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a></span></strong><span> 📉 职场变差的底层原因：</span><strong><span>机会少，人多</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a></span></strong><span> 🧾 HR vs 猎头：supporting function 的难量化 vs 业绩岗位的结果导向</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a></span></strong><span> 🍯☠️ 选择的代价：</span><strong><span>甲之蜜糖，乙之砒霜</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a></span></strong><span> ⚡ 短择时代：jumpy、需要即时正反馈，很难长期投入</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1059">17:39</a></span></strong><span> 🏢 外企也没滤镜：环境未必体面，“会不会来事”很现实</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a></span></strong><span> ✍️ “抄作业”故事：原则与灵活、操作空间、关系训练</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1585">26:25</a></span></strong><span> 👀 管理者视角：团队集体排斥一个人时，领导也很难扛</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a></span></strong><span> ⏳ 两个月“判死刑”：试用期逻辑与残酷筛选</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a></span></strong><span> 🧠 公司文化对比：日企“情怀与大礼包” vs 韩企“规则破坏者赢优势”</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">33:21</a></span></strong><span> 🌿 心态哲学：</span><strong><span>别以快乐为目标</span></strong><span>；人生是一场体验</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a></span></strong><span> 💸 投资观：发财执念 vs 把研究当事业；“不研究也赚钱的爽感”</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2327">38:47</a></span></strong><span> 收束：把别人的课题还给别人，把自己的选择扛起来</span></p><span></span><h2><span>✅ 本期要点（听完你能带走什么）</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>黑红不是护身符</span></strong><span>：价值观一旦出事，反噬比你想象更快。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>别把平台当能力</span></strong><span>：平台给你的光环，离开平台未必还在。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>职场更难的真相</span></strong><span>：不一定是你变差了，是 </span><strong><span>“机会少，人多”</span></strong><span>。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>专注≠入局</span></strong><span>：很多人忙得很认真，其实是 </span><strong><span>“专注地心猿意马”</span></strong><span>。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>短择时代的焦虑</span></strong><span>：大家更想要即时反馈，长期投入更难。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>投资别追爽感</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>不研究就想发财</span></strong><span>，往往是掉坑的起点。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>主播：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>菲凡：外企hr，野生博主，INTP</span></p><span></span><p><span>Echo（小丹）：上海医药猎头合伙人，前500强人力资源经理，面试/转行/职业规划咨询师, ENTP</span></p><span></span><p><span>-互动联系-</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务/听友群加微信： lynnwang823</span></p>]]></description>
